B.ao_=new A.mN("memberships",2,"Memberships","Annual or rolling membership of the kennel.\n\nThe membership TERM is not set here. It lives on the kennel itself, in Edit Kennel, so that one club cannot offer two memberships of different lengths and leave the expiry maths ambiguous.",B.aiO,0,"memberships")
